       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INITACCT.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT ACCOUNT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DA-I-ACCTFILE
               ACCESS IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY IS ACCOUNT-ID
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  ACCOUNT-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           RECORD CONTAINS 119 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS ACCOUNT-RECORD.

       01  ACCOUNT-RECORD.
           COPY MBACCT.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  WS-FILE-STATUS          PIC XX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAIN-PROCESS.

           OPEN OUTPUT ACCOUNT-FILE.

           IF WS-FILE-STATUS NOT = '00'
               DISPLAY 'INITACCT OPEN FAILED FS=' WS-FILE-STATUS
               STOP RUN.

           MOVE SPACES TO ACCOUNT-RECORD.
           MOVE 'A' TO ACCOUNT-STATUS.
           MOVE 'A000000000000' TO ACCOUNT-ID.
           MOVE 'C000000000006' TO ACCOUNT-CUSTOMER-ID.
           MOVE 'DE89370400440532013000' TO ACCOUNT-IBAN.
           MOVE 'ST' TO ACCOUNT-TYPE.
           MOVE 'EUR' TO ACCOUNT-CURRENCY.
           MOVE ZERO TO ACCOUNT-BALANCE
                        ACCOUNT-OVERDRAFT
                        ACCOUNT-BLOCKED.
           MOVE '20260904000000' TO ACCOUNT-CREATED-AT
                                    ACCOUNT-UPDATED-AT.

           WRITE ACCOUNT-RECORD
               INVALID KEY
                   DISPLAY 'INITACCT WRITE FAILED FS='
                           WS-FILE-STATUS
                   CLOSE ACCOUNT-FILE
                   STOP RUN.

           CLOSE ACCOUNT-FILE.

           DISPLAY 'INITACCT CREATED A000000000000'.
           STOP RUN.

